# Everything that makes a daily-driver machine pleasant but that a VM or a
# short-lived box does not need. Drop this whole layer with:
#   dotfiles install --profile mac-full --without mac-apps-extra
# or comment out individual lines here.

cask slack
cask zoom
cask spotify
cask discord
cask podman-desktop
cask daisydisk

